0..49 Comment "/// A module\'s name is a value of its model type."
50..53 Comment "///"
54..129 Comment "/// A module is a value of a model type, so a name needs no `pack` to stand"
130..141 Comment "/// as one."
142..145 Comment "///"
146..218 Comment "/// The name `Up` reads as `pack Up at Model(Ticker)`, the record of its"
219..274 Comment "/// members, at the model type its own header ascribes."
